UID:798af262c46ed07e@altar.bike
CATEGORIES:trail-work
DESCRIPTION:Join Carolina Mountain Club and Pisgah Area SORBA for a joint 
 work day on the north side of Pink Beds! No experience is necessary - the 
 Carolina Mountain Club and Pisgah SORBA Trail Crew Leaders will provide al
 l tools\, guidance\, and instruction. We’ll meet at the new paved parkin
 g lot next to the Ranger Station and carpool up to Pink Beds. Date: Friday
 \, October 9th Time: 8:30 AM – 2:00 PM Trail Work Location: North side o
 f Pink Beds Loop Meetup Location: Pisgah Ranger Station/Visitor Center Req
 uired items: Long pants\, boots that cover your ankles\, safety glasses\, 
 gloves\, hardhat (bike helmets DO NOT count\, but climbing helmets do)\, s
 nacks/lunch and water. Note: Hardhats\, gloves and safety glasses can be p
 rovided if needed. All tools will be provided. Come help our two trail org
 anizations g\n\nMore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisgah A
 rea SORBA\n\nListed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:Pisgah Ranger Station/Visitor Center\, Pisgah Highway\, Pisgah Fo
 rest\, NC\, USA\, Pisgah Forest\, NC
URL:https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/
END:VEVENT
